    "Only an atomic same-parent no-clobber rename is allowed; there is no copy fallback, no directory creation, and no change to the other side." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only an atomic same-parent no-clobber rename is allowed; there is no copy fallback, no directory creation, and no change to the other side."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅允许在同一父目录内执行原子且不覆盖的重命名；不会回退到复制，不会创建目录，也不会更改另一侧。"
