            "value" : "Riffa 会跟随 macOS 的对比度、动态效果、透明度和颜色设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa follows your macOS accessibility preferences." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa follows your macOS accessibility preferences."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 会遵循 macOS 的辅助功能偏好设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa found a non-terminal record. No automatic rollback is attempted from this viewer; inspect the roots and backup before changing files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa found a non-terminal record. No automatic rollback is attempted from this viewer; inspect the roots and backup before changing files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 发现了一条非终端记录。此查看器不会尝试自动回滚；在更改文件之前检查根目录和备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa indexes archives read-only, validates every path, and never follows stored links." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa indexes archives read-only, validates every path, and never follows stored links."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 以只读方式索引归档文件、验证每条路径，且绝不跟随归档中存储的链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa keeps the comparison on this Mac and preserves line endings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa keeps the comparison on this Mac and preserves line endings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 在此 Mac 上完成比较，并保留原有换行符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa normalizes both images to RGBA pixels and compares them locally." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa normalizes both images to RGBA pixels and compares them locally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 将两个图像标准化为 RGBA 像素并在本地进行比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa pairs relative paths and keeps symbolic links bounded by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa pairs relative paths and keeps symbolic links bounded by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 会配对相对路径，并默认限制符号链接范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa parses CSV, TSV, semicolon, and pipe-delimited text without uploading it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa parses CSV, TSV, semicolon, and pipe-delimited text without uploading it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 解析 CSV、TSV、分号和管道分隔文本而不上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa parses bounded unified diffs, validates every hunk in memory, and writes only after you review the result." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa parses bounded unified diffs, validates every hunk in memory, and writes only after you review the result."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 解析受限的统一差异，在内存中验证每个补丁块，并且仅在你检查结果后写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa shows same-offset byte differences without changing either file." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa shows same-offset byte differences without changing either file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 显示相同偏移字节差异，而不更改任何一个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa validated every patch hunk. Replacing preserves the source's %@ representation and line endings. The write is blocked if another process changed the file. You can instead keep the result only in the editing buffer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "value" : "Riffa validated every patch hunk. Replacing preserves the source's %@ representation and line endings. The write is blocked if another process changed the file. You can instead keep the result only in the editing buffer.",
            "state" : "translated"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 已验证每个补丁块。替换时会保留源文件的%@表示形式和换行符。如果其他进程已更改文件，写入将被阻止。你也可以仅将结果保留在编辑缓冲区中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa will not send Basic or Bearer credentials over a non-HTTPS WebDAV connection." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa will not send Basic or Bearer credentials over a non-HTTPS WebDAV connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 不会通过非 HTTPS 的 WebDAV 连接发送 Basic 或 Bearer 凭证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa will preflight the whole plan again. Replaced and deleted targets will be moved to %@, and any failure will trigger a best-effort rollback.%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa will preflight the whole plan again. Replaced and deleted targets will be moved to %1$@, and any failure will trigger a best-effort rollback.%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 将再次预检整个计划。被替换和删除的目标会移至%@，任何失败都会触发尽力回滚。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa will preflight this exact immutable plan again, require the high-risk execution gate, and record the formal attempt in Operation History. Any later failure triggers best-effort rollback." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa will preflight this exact immutable plan again, require the high-risk execution gate, and record the formal attempt in Operation History. Any later failure triggers best-effort rollback."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 会再次预检这个精确且不可变的计划，要求通过高风险执行确认，并将正式尝试记录在操作历史中。任何后续失败都会触发尽力回滚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Riffa will reload the active journal, verify its status and revision, and inspect every recorded path again. If all evidence is unchanged, it will update only the journal metadata. It will not copy, move, delete, restore, or modify any file. Archiving remains a separate action." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa will reload the active journal, verify its status and revision, and inspect every recorded path again. If all evidence is unchanged, it will update only the journal metadata. It will not copy, move, delete, restore, or modify any file. Archiving remains a separate action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riffa 将重新载入活动日志，验证其状态和修订版本，并再次检查所有记录的路径。如果所有证据均未变化，则只更新日志元数据；不会复制、移动、删除、恢复或修改任何文件。归档仍是独立操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
